    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSpacious 4-Bedroom Homes Limited Availability\n\nSouth Coast is the latest addition to Castlethorn's landmark Woodbrook development, set in one of South County Dublin's most desirable locations. Perfectly positioned between the mountains and the sea, the development lies beside Shanganagh Park and Woodbrook Golf Club, with access from the Old Dublin Road just south of Shankill village and close to Bray.\n\nA major highlight is the brand-new DART station now open in Woodbrook, offering transformative connectivity to the city and surrounding coastal suburbs. This makes South Coast at Woodbrook an ideal location for commuters and families alike.\n\nAs part of the overall masterplan, Woodbrook will also include a school, crèche, and a neighbourhood centre, ensuring a well-rounded, community-focused lifestyle. Residents will enjoy easy access to local amenities including beaches at Shankill, Bray, and Killiney, along with a selection of excellent schools and top-tier shopping.\n\nLocated in the northern part of the development, South Coast is laid out in a series of charming, well-planned streets. A diverse range of homes is available everything from stylish 3-bedroom townhouses to spacious 4-bedroom family homes with garages. Future phases will also include duplexes and apartments, with the first houses launching from plans in late 2025.\n\nAll homes in Woodbrook are built to Castlethorn's renowned high standards, with an A-rating for energy efficiency and contemporary finishes throughout.\n\nFamilies will benefit from proximity to leading primary and secondary schools, including Woodbrook College, Scoil Mhuire, St. Gerard's, Presentation College, St. Killian's, and Loreto Secondary School. Nearby Shankill Village provides everyday conveniences, while Carrickmines Retail Park and Dundrum Town Centre offer premium shopping options, both easily reached by car.\n\nTo find out more or to register your interest, visit www.south-coast.ie or contact Sherry FitzGerald New Homes at +353 1 667 1888.\n\nUpon registering your details will be passed to Castlethorn and Sherry FitzGerald"
      },
